{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cast once, reel in\u2014simple as that. <i>Effortless Catch</i> turns angling into a stress-free meditation: tap a card and the fish yields itself. In the spare seconds between life\u2019s waves, upgrade rods, unlock hooks and lures, weave stronger lines. Every lure and catch becomes a beautiful card to collect, fuse, and evolve into your ultimate tackle box. No energy bars, no leaderboard angst\u2014just gentle ripples, golden sunsets, and the next surprise bite.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3832360?t=1753598104","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3832360?t=1753598104","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832360/b13b94ec90e18532263f5b6734751e8ddd7b3da8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753598104","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832360/b13b94ec90e18532263f5b6734751e8ddd7b3da8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753598104","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cast once, reel in\u2014simple as that. <i>Effortless Catch</i> turns angling into a stress-free meditation: tap a card and the fish yields itself. In the spare seconds between life\u2019s waves, upgrade rods, unlock hooks and lures, weave stronger lines. Every lure and catch becomes a beautiful card to collect, fuse, and evolve into your ultimate tackle box. No energy bars, no leaderboard angst\u2014just gentle ripples, golden sunsets, and the next surprise bite.</p>","developers":["JLL"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832360/ed2eb5689f7e8c87dc71861148c471a6faac4289/header.jpg?t=1753598104","is_free